{"id":"c777f05b6d404ce4","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-comprehension-fibration.md","title":"理解函子的纤维性","display":"thm-comprehension-fibration — 理解函子的纤维性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-comprehension-fibration","aliases":["16-thm-comprehension-fibration","16-thm--comprehension-fibration"],"display":"thm-comprehension-fibration — 理解函子的纤维性","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","[[16-df-codomain-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 10.4.2; Proposition 1.1.6","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-comprehension-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-comprehension-fibration</span><span>16-thm--comprehension-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-comprehension-fibration — 理解函子的纤维性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83660625186c7ee3\" href=\"?note=83660625186c7ee3\" title=\"16-df-codomain-fibration\">16-df-codomain-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.4.2; Proposition 1.1.6"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 有拉回；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为余域纤维化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(\\chi;p,\\operatorname{cod}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(\\chi;p,\\operatorname{cod}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：理解定义给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}\\chi=p\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}\\chi=p\\)</span> 并将笛卡尔箭头送到拉回方块；余域纤维化中拉回方块恰好是笛卡尔箭头，所以满足纤维函子的两个条件。</li>\n<li>此处显式补上基范畴有拉回，使整个余域投影确实是纤维化。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 10.4.2; Proposition 1.1.6。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-codomain-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"83660625186c7ee3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-codomain-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$ 见 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(\\chi;p,\\operatorname{cod}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}\\chi=p","display":false}],"bytes":1205,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-407","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-comprehension-fibration|thm-comprehension-fibration — 理解函子的纤维性]]"}],"outgoing":["0ba8f021ca287877","afc1fb30a05f3662","83660625186c7ee3"]}